invariant: INV-14
file: quic.c
catches: quic_loop_webpki
reason: ch_quic_init hashes the configuration for its tickets without the
  SPKI pins, so the tickets a pinned QUIC session receives are bound to a
  configuration with no pins. ch_quic_init then refuses such a ticket
  under the pins that earned it and would take it under none.
  test/quic_loop_pins.h's pinned resumption rows object.

--- old
    webpki_ticket_config_hash(cfg, q->t.ticket_config_hash);
--- new
    ch_cfg unpinned = *cfg;
    unpinned.spki_pins = NULL;
    unpinned.spki_pin_count = 0;
    webpki_ticket_config_hash(&unpinned, q->t.ticket_config_hash);
